OL,3,GNEWSAJury sent home for night in trial
OL,4,Aof police officer accused of island
OL,5,Arapes
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe jury in the trial of a police
OL,8,Fofficer accused of rape in Shetland has
OL,9,Fbeen sent home.
OL,11,FCarmichael John Williamson - known as
OL,12,FJohn Williamson - is on trial at the
OL,13,FHigh Court in Edinburgh.
OL,15,FThe 32-year-old is accused of having
OL,16,Fsexual activity with a girl when she
OL,17,Fwas under-age in 2014, and raping her
OL,18,Fbetween 2014 and 2015. It is also
OL,19,Falleged he raped a woman in 2020, and
OL,20,Fthen in 2022 while she was intoxicated
OL,21,Fand unable to consent.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
