OL,3,GNEWSAJury sent home for night in trial
OL,4,Aof police officer accused of island
OL,5,Arapes
OL,6,
OL,7,FOn the third day of the trial,
OL,8,Fprosecution and defence closing
OL,9,Fspeeches were heard before judge John
OL,10,FMorris KC charged the jury. They began
OL,11,Ftheir deliberations in the afternoon
OL,12,Fbut were later sent home and will
OL,13,Fresume on Thursday morning.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
